title: Keep trace events when state_traceBlock filters are empty
doc:
  - audience:
      - Node Dev
      - Node Operator
    description: |
      Treat an explicitly empty storage key or method filter in state_traceBlock as no
      filtering for that field, matching the documented RPC contract. This preserves events
      without the filtered field, including keyless storage events such as ClearPrefix and
      StorageRoot, and the state machine's Call event (which has a method but no key).
      Non-empty filters continue to match only the named field.
      Omitted filters (None) retain their existing behavior of dropping every event.
crates:
  - name: sc-tracing
    bump: patch
